Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joy and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.00,0:01:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know if I can. I believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure I'll fly, oh my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only was everything exactly the\Nsame as it was when I left for camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was even the same day\NI arrived in Digi-World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other things were weird, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My little sister, Kari,\Nsomehow knew all about Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason, evil Digimon were\Ntrying to cross over into the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.92,0:02:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We received a transmission from Izzy\Nwarning us not to return to Digi-World,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.42,0:02:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we knew we had to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had to save both worlds!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.64,0:02:15.07,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}The Whispering Little Demon, PicoDevimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sasa-yaku ko-akuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiko-de-bi-mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really sound like you\Nknow what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just watch a lot of TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what is a click?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.56,0:02:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly,\Nbut we're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.70,0:02:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope so. I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this place. Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's the most\Nbeautiful place I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:02:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The signal's getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is it? Who is it? It's Tokomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey what happened little\Nguy are you all right you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look like Tai you are Tai\Nyou're alive yeah the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.42,0:03:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i checked i'll bet a black\Near digimon got you right
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no if it was something\Nsimple like that i wouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel so bad where is\Neverybody where's tk i don't
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know he's probably out for\Nthis new friend new friend
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what new friend i think you\Nbetter ask tk i would but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's not here and you are\Nnow start at the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.64,0:03:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to come on and tell me\Nexactly what happened well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were gone an awful long\Ntime we were how long we
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.90,0:03:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looked high enough for you\Ni did most of the low part
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finally it's no use we're\Npractically lost ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh personally i've been\Nlost ever since i got here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what about jenna maybe he\Ncan help us find them yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and where do we find jenna\Ni think one wild goose chase
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is enough this is the most\Ndepressing camp out ever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't tk be upset maybe\Nbut he'll be safer here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shh we're going off to find Tai on her own
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't wake anyone we'll\Nsee you later tokomon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:31.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,okay that's how it started\Nfirst sora left then we all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.76,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,went in search of sora And\Nsomeone said maybe we'd cover
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more ground if we split up\NSo Izzy and Tentomon went up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.22,0:04:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one way And Joe and Gomamon\Nwent up another And pretty soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only Matt, TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, and me were left
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did everybody go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.42,0:04:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're supposed to stay\Ntogether We just had
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,different ideas of what\Nwas the best thing to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK We've looked everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK If they were anywhere in this area,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:04:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we would have found them We\Ncould have missed something,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we gotta keep searching Come on, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hurry, we can\Nstill catch up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.02,0:05:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's hopeless, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've already done everything we could.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.68,0:05:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wherever Agumon and Tai are, I'm\Nsure they're perfectly all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any minute now, they'll\Nbe coming back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'll bring a bunch\Nof presents with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.84,0:05:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow. You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.60,0:05:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure miss my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew Matt was just kidding TK about\Nthe presents, But that didn't matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because just then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's gonna love this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Matt didn't seem too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like there was something on his\Nmind that he couldn't stop thinking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this. No lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.14,0:05:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, there are no people here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.06,0:05:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they forgot to tell\Nus that they're closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, TK, you sure you'll be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.14,0:05:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.32,0:06:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't worry about me That's my big little\Nbro But you'll be back pretty soon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.69,0:06:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just gonna look around a\Nlittle Really check this place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out I'll be back in maybe a couple\Nof hours at the most Tokomon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.16,0:06:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're responsible for\Nlooking after him, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.46,0:06:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll be waiting right here Great, and\Nremember it's an amusement park So,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like, amuse yourself\NSee you soon Okay, bye
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hours went by and still no Matt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. I wonder what's\Nkeeping them. You've got
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eat something Should\Nhave come back by now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We waited at the park for almost\Na week TK spent the whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,staring out at the water Except when\Nhe just couldn't stay awake anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He waited and waited

